{title: 213 - Jesus Is Coming Again}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #213 • JESUS IS COMING AGAIN • 17.17.15}
{lyricist: Jessie E. Strout}
{composer: George E. Lee}
{key: A}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 213}
{meta: tune JESUS IS COMING AGAIN}
{meta: meter 17.17.15}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F#m/C#]Lift up the trumpet, and loud let it ring: Jesus [E]is coming again!
[F#m/C#]Cheer up, ye pilgrims, be joyful and [A]sing: Jesus [Bm]is coming again!
[G#dim]Coming again, [F#m/C#]coming again, Jesus is coming again!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[E]Coming again, [C#m/E]coming again,
[C#m/E]Jesus is coming again!
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F#m/C#]Echo it, hilltops; proclaim [E]it, ye plains:
[F#m/C#]Jesus is coming [Bm]again!
[F#m/C#]Coming in glory, [A]the Lamb [Bm]that was slain;
[G#dim]Jesus [F#m/C#]is coming again!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F#m/C#]Heavings of earth, tell the vast, [E]wondering throng:
[F#m/C#]Jesus is coming [Bm]again!
[F#m/C#]Tempests and whirlwinds, [A]the anthem [Bm]prolong;
[G#dim]Jesus [F#m/C#]is coming again!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[F#m/C#]Nations are angry--by [E]this we do know
[F#m/C#]Jesus is coming [Bm]again!
[F#m/C#]Knowledge increases; [A]men run [Bm]to and fro;
[G#dim]Jesus [F#m/C#]is coming again!
{end_of_verse}
